WEBVTT

00:00:01.459 --> 00:00:03.672
Prompt Batch turns one template

00:00:03.672 --> 00:00:06.215
into a whole collection of prompts.

00:00:06.375 --> 00:00:09.849
For each variable, choose whether to lock it, randomise

00:00:09.849 --> 00:00:13.262
it, step through its values in order, or repeat them.

00:00:13.704 --> 00:00:17.182
Set the batch size and an output format, then generate.

00:00:17.745 --> 00:00:21.561
Review the list, copy it all, or download it for another tool.
